{
  "moon": [
    {
      "text": "Look up at the Moon tonight. Its",
      "startMs": 166.66666666666666,
      "endMs": 2420.8574701358207,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "familiar pattern of dark plains always faces",
      "startMs": 2420.8574701358207,
      "endMs": 5520.369824905909,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "roughly the same way.",
      "startMs": 5520.369824905909,
      "endMs": 6999.682539682541,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The Moon turns once on its axis",
      "startMs": 8166.666666666666,
      "endMs": 10487.74125790667,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "in about 27.3 days. It also takes",
      "startMs": 10487.74125790667,
      "endMs": 12958.562596968612,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "about 27.3 days to orbit Earth.",
      "startMs": 12958.562596968612,
      "endMs": 15279.637188208615,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "This matching rhythm is called synchronous rotation.",
      "startMs": 16166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 19449.11644893946,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "As the Moon moves around Earth, the",
      "startMs": 19449.11644893946,
      "endMs": 21658.457648546148,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "same side keeps facing us.",
      "startMs": 21658.457648546148,
      "endMs": 23299.682539682544,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A gentle apparent wobble, called libration, lets",
      "startMs": 24166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 27482.888650196925,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "us see about 59% of the lunar",
      "startMs": 27482.888650196925,
      "endMs": 29486.439431913117,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "surface over time.",
      "startMs": 29486.439431913117,
      "endMs": 30730.02267573696,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "ocean": [
    {
      "text": "A glass of water looks clear. Yet",
      "startMs": 166.66666666666666,
      "endMs": 2859.8772552499263,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "a deep ocean often looks blue. The",
      "startMs": 2859.8772552499263,
      "endMs": 5634.700285911466,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "depth makes a difference.",
      "startMs": 5634.700285911466,
      "endMs": 7675.011337868481,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight contains many wavelengths. Water absorbs the",
      "startMs": 8166.666666666666,
      "endMs": 11868.116618075803,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "red part of the spectrum more strongly",
      "startMs": 11868.116618075803,
      "endMs": 14521.986394557824,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "than the blue.",
      "startMs": 14521.986394557824,
      "endMs": 15499.727891156463,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "As light travels through deep water, more",
      "startMs": 16166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 18619.134478650216,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "of the red light is absorbed. The",
      "startMs": 18619.134478650216,
      "endMs": 20593.07198585649,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "light that returns to our eyes is",
      "startMs": 20593.07198585649,
      "endMs": 22567.009493062764,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "often blue.",
      "startMs": 22567.009493062764,
      "endMs": 23224.98866213152,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Plankton, sediment, depth and reflected sky can",
      "startMs": 24166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 26853.079811159438,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "all change the color. That is why",
      "startMs": 26853.079811159438,
      "endMs": 28739.284784952233,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "coastal water can look green or turquoise.",
      "startMs": 28739.284784952233,
      "endMs": 31139.909297052156,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "fern": [
    {
      "text": "Inside a leaf, tiny structures called chloroplasts",
      "startMs": 166.66666666666666,
      "endMs": 3308.294657426833,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "contain chlorophyll, a pigment that captures light",
      "startMs": 3308.294657426833,
      "endMs": 6449.922648187,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "energy.",
      "startMs": 6449.922648187,
      "endMs": 6889.750566893424,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Roots supply water. Small pores in the",
      "startMs": 8166.666666666666,
      "endMs": 11145.803840523551,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "leaves let in carbon dioxide from the",
      "startMs": 11145.803840523551,
      "endMs": 14046.542667699992,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "air.",
      "startMs": 14046.542667699992,
      "endMs": 14360.13605442177,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Photosynthesis uses light energy to help turn",
      "startMs": 16166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 19131.835426478283,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "water and carbon dioxide into sugars that",
      "startMs": 19131.835426478283,
      "endMs": 21833.433629862204,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "support the plant.",
      "startMs": 21833.433629862204,
      "endMs": 23019.50113378685,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxygen is released along the way. The",
      "startMs": 24166.666666666668,
      "endMs": 26852.13196389667,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "green world around us is doing chemistry",
      "startMs": 26852.13196389667,
      "endMs": 29755.337690631808,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "with sunlight, every day.",
      "startMs": 29755.337690631808,
      "endMs": 31569.84126984127,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ]
